---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro'; import Header from '../../components/Header.astro'; import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro'; import {serviceAreas} from '../../data/serviceAreas';
---
<MainLayout title="Drain Cleaning Service Area | Mason City & North Iowa | A-1 Drain Cleaning" description="A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City and travels for drain cleaning and sewer service in Clear Lake, Rockwell, Charles City, Osage, Forest City, Northwood, Lake Mills, Hampton and nearby communities." path="/service-area/"><Header/><main id="main"><section class="bg-white py-12 md:py-16"><div class="container"><p class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#D9383A]">Where we work</p><h1 class="brand mt-2 text-5xl text-[#1A1A68]">Drain Cleaning in Mason City and North Iowa</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-xl">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City and travels for drain cleaning and sewer work. If you are outside Mason City, call and ask—we cover surrounding communities rather than limiting service to one town.</p><a href="tel:+16415302728" class="phone-pulse mt-7 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#D9383A] px-6 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Call 641-530-2728</a></div></section><section class="py-14"><div class="container"><h2 class="brand text-3xl text-[#1A1A68]">Communities A-1 serves</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-gray-700">The list below shows communities in the current service area. Availability can depend on the job and schedule.</p><div class="mt-7 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">{serviceAreas.map(city=><div class="rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 font-semibold">{city}</div>)}</div></div></section><section class="bg-[#f5f5f5] py-14"><div class="container grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2"><div><h2 class="brand text-3xl text-[#1A1A68]">What A-1 comes out for</h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">Clogged sinks, showers, tubs and toilets. Basement floor drains. Washing machine drains. Main drain and sewer line blockages. Sewer backups. Tree roots. Drain repairs. Hydro jetting when appropriate. Sump pump problems and other drain-related work.</p></div><div><h2 class="brand text-3xl text-[#1A1A68]">Not sure what you need?</h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">You do not need to know the name of the problem before calling. Tell A-1 what the water is doing, which fixture is affected, and whether other drains are backing up.</p><a href="tel:+16415302728" class="mt-5 inline-block font-bold text-[#D9383A] underline">Call 641-530-2728</a></div></div></section></main><Footer/></MainLayout>
